At Devoteam, we believe that technology with strong human values can actively drive change for the better. Discover how Tech for People unlocks the future, creating a positive impact on the people and the world around us. We are a global leading player in Digital Transformation for leading organisations across EMEA, with a revenue of €652M. We believe in transforming technology to create value for our clients, partners and employees in a world where technology is developed for people. We are proud of the culture we have built together. We are proud of our people at the service of technology. We are proud of our diverse environment. Because we are #TechforPeople. Join our multidisciplinary team of Cloud experts, Designers, Business consultants, Security experts, Engineers, Developers and other extraordinary talents, spread across more than 18 EMEA countries. Become one of our +8.000 tech and business leaders on cloud, data and cyber security. Let’s fuse creativity with technology together and build innovative solutions that actively change things for the better.

Job Description

Strategic Leadership & Autonomy

Take full control of the technical and support the functional environment of missions. You are responsible for designing the best architecture, support staffing, delegating, and prioritising work to ensure project success;
Swiftly adapt to unexpected project shifts and navigate complex organisational landscapes with autonomy;
Be part of an engagement management team, supporting the financial aspects of projects and missions, ensuring delivery remains within scope and budget;

Technical Excellence & Quality Assurance

Act as a recognised expert and a point of reference for employees across the group in your specific domain;
More than 7+ years designing highly scalable and resilient solutions with Java, .Net or Python, using modern architectures and main patterns. Extensive experience deploying on one of the main cloud providers (Azure, GCP or AWS);
Foster awareness and implementation of quality management principles, processes, and tools to ensure differentiated deliverables;
Leverage a profound technological culture to understand client stakes and react with solutions that provide a competitive edge;

Client Relationship & Business Development

Establish long-lasting relationships with clients, influencing their strategic decisions and anticipating future needs;
Lead the design and drafting of complex sales proposals. You will be a key player in negotiations and technical pre-sales activities;
Proactively propose improvements to the client’s organisation and processes based on technical insights;

Complex Problem Solving

Understand and articulate the client’s vision, identifying potential roadblocks and crafting robust, scalable solutions;
Analyse risks that threaten project progress and implement decisive action plans. You remain calm and focused when leading teams through crises;
Lead high-level workshops and meetings in complex, multi-stakeholder environments;

Mentorship & Learning Agility

Actively coach third parties, both internally at Devoteam and at client sites, to elevate the overall skill level of the team;
Quickly assimilate new technologies and methodologies, encouraging a positive and innovative learning environment for others;
Be a driving force in training activities and the continuous broadening of professional horizons for the consultant community;

Internal Contribution & Community Building

Serve as a Devoteam ambassador, communicating corporate strategy and values to both clients and internal collaborators;
Actively participate in the growth of the entity through direct recruitment interviews and cooptation;
Own and maintain internal networks, contributing significantly to technical and methodological communities and the development of Devoteam’s service offers.

Qualifications

Extensive experience in solution architecture with a proven track record of leading complex digital transformations;
Impactful public speaking skills with the ability to federate and convince stakeholders, even in challenging environments. Good English (minimum B2) is a requirement;
Demonstrated ability to inspire others, identify individual strengths within a team, and build high-performing units;
Strong understanding of the strategic and practical ramifications of technical decisions;
Advanced level of English (spoken and written).

Additional Information

The Devoteam Group works for equal opportunities, promoting its employees based on merit and actively fights against all forms of discrimination. We are convinced that diversity contributes to the creativity, dynamism and excellence of our organization. All of our vacancies are open to people with disabilities.

Discover more about our universe, for additional information, visit our website -> https://www.devoteam.com/expertise/creative-tech/

